OL,3,ADame Judi Dench: 'I can't do a play, a
OL,4,Afilm or read any more'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOscar-winning actress Dame Judi Dench
OL,7,Fsays her eye condition has left her
OL,8,Funable to perform on stage or read,
OL,9,Fmore than a decade after she was
OL,10,Fdiagnosed.
OL,12,FDench was diagnosed with age-related
OL,13,Fmacular degeneration (AMD) in 2012, a
OL,14,Fcondition that affects her vision and
OL,15,Fhas made it incredibly difficult to
OL,16,Feven recognise faces.
OL,18,FSpeaking to Emma Barnett on BBC Radio
OL,19,F4's Today programme, she said: "I can't
OL,20,Fbe on stage. I can't do a play anymore.
OL,21,FI can't do a film anymore. I can't read
OL,22,Fanymore."
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/20
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
